<h1>Reminders not sent for <%= @show.name %></h1>

<p>Reminders for <strong><%= @show %></strong> couldn’t start automatically: <%= @reason %></p>

<%- if @will_retry -%>
<p>They’ll be tried again automatically until they start.</p>
<%- else -%>
<p>They won’t be tried again automatically. Send them from the show page.</p>
<%- end -%>

<p><%= link_to "View #{@show.name}", madmin_show_url(@show) %></p>
